{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/revcontentsdk\/scrollcontextplacement"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/revcontentsdk\/scrollcontextplacement"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Scroll context placement","modules":[{"name":"RevcontentSDK"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revcontentScrollContext()"},{"type":"text","text":" inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"’s content, not on the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":" itself."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"RevcontentAdView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" reports widget visibility back to the underlying widget JavaScript so impressions, viewability, and intersection events fire correctly. To do that, the SDK needs a reference to the enclosing "},{"code":"UIScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/SwiftUICore\/View\/revcontentScrollContext()"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier walks the view hierarchy at attach time to find that scroll view. It must be applied to a view that is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"inside"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"’s content — not to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":" itself, where it would walk the hierarchy "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"above"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the scroll view and miss it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Misplace the modifier and the SDK’s DEBUG assertions will fire immediately during development. In release, the SDK falls back to a warning and impression data will be missing or inaccurate."}]},{"text":"Right way","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Right-way"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply the modifier to a view inside the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s content:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["ScrollView {","    VStack {","        ArticleBody()","        RevcontentAdView(widgetId: \"abc-123\")","    }","    .revcontentScrollContext()","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The modifier is on the ","type":"text"},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which is inside the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The finder walks up from the ","type":"text"},{"code":"VStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and discovers the enclosing ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Wrong way","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wrong-way"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not apply the modifier to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" itself:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ WRONG — finder walks above the ScrollView and finds nothing","ScrollView {","    VStack {","        ArticleBody()","        RevcontentAdView(widgetId: \"abc-123\")","    }","}",".revcontentScrollContext()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Also wrong: forgetting the modifier entirely. The SDK provides a default empty scroll context as a fallback, so "},{"code":"RevcontentAdView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" will still render — but no scroll-driven events will fire, and DEBUG builds will assert."}]},{"text":"Why this design","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Why-this-design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI doesn’t expose the underlying ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. The modifier installs a tiny invisible ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as a background, then walks up the superview chain at window-attachment time to locate the scroll view. Apply it inside the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s content for that walk to succeed.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Articles","generated":true,"title":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/ThemeIntegration","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/UIKitAndObjectiveC","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/JSEventContract"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/ScrollContextPlacement","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Related-modifiers","title":"Related modifiers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/SwiftUICore\/View\/revcontentScrollContext()","doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK\/RevcontentAdView"]}],"references":{"doc://com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK/documentation/RevcontentSDK":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK\/documentation\/RevcontentSDK","url":"\/documentation\/revcontentsdk","title":"RevcontentSDK","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Native SwiftUI integration for Revcontent ad widgets."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.revcontent.RevcontentSDK/documentation/RevcontentSDK/SwiftUICore/View/revcontentScrollContext()":{"role":